WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.061
Complete the revised guide with explanation, an example, usable practice, a purposeful question and a clear next action.

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:13.088
The example subtotal is one hundred forty dollars.

00:00:13.088 --> 00:00:21.645
Practice with two hours at fifty dollars per hour plus fifteen dollars gives one hundred fifteen dollars.

00:00:21.645 --> 00:00:26.679
State that these are invented figures and retain excluded costs.

00:00:26.679 --> 00:00:35.739
Verify the claims independently, record source permissions and attribution, and explain one factual correction and one voice improvement.

00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:41.780
Inspect readable directions and whether the person can perform the intended action.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.807
A scenario does not establish actual audience usefulness.

00:00:45.807 --> 00:00:53.861
Save the revised sample, evidence, questions and human decision in the continuing Project Record and workbook.

00:00:53.861 --> 00:00:55.874
Hold unresolved necessary claims.

00:00:55.874 --> 00:00:58.895
Saving does not publish a product.

00:00:58.895 --> 00:01:03.425
Carry this same sample into Lesson Four Point Four.
